    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The P.S. part is a bit weird, can you remove that? I need this to be strictly professional for legal reasons. Also, can you add a sentence mentioning that if it isn't fixed within a few days, I might have to look into a rent reduction (Mietminderung) under German law? I want to sound firm but polite.",
